### Admin / debug levers — the fastest way to force the world into a
### specific state instead of simulating your way there.
###
### Needs BOTH:
###   * a ROLE_ADMIN session, and
###   * the X-Admin-Token header
### Run ### adminLogin in 00-auth.http first; it stores {{adminToken}}.

### Every not-yet-played match this season, with any predetermined score on it
# @name upcomingMatches
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/upcomingMatches
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Force an exact scoreline. The simulator picks it up on the next
### simulateRound for that competition/round — this is how you reproduce a
### qualification or tie-break bug without fighting the RNG.
# @name setScore
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/setScore
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "competitionId": 1,
  "seasonNumber": 1,
  "roundNumber": 1,
  "team1Id": 1,
  "team2Id": 2,
  "team1Score": 3,
  "team2Score": 0
}

### Scores queued but not yet consumed
# @name predeterminedScores
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/predeterminedScores
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Drop a queued score
# @name deletePredetermined
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/predeterminedScore/1
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Money

### @name fundingOptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finances/funding-options
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### @name injectMoney
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/injectMoney
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "amount": 50000000
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Squad manipulation

### Generate a player into a team — skips the transfer market entirely
# @name generatePlayer
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/generatePlayer
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "position": "ST",
  "age": 24
}

### @name extendContract
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/contracts/extend
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "years": 3
}

### Move a player directly, no negotiation
# @name forceTransfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "toTeamId": 2,
  "fee": 1000000
}

### @name transferHistory
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transfers
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Competition repair and draws

### Pending draws
# @name draws
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/draws
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### @name completeDraws
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/draws/complete
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Rebuild a Stars Cup field left broken by the legacy cup-points rule
# @name repairStarsCup
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/competitions/repair-stars-cup/{{season}}
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Job offers and awards

### @name jobOfferState
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobOffers/state
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### @name forceNextJobOffer
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobOffers/forceNext
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### @name ballonDor
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/awards/ballon-dor
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Best tactic the engine can find for a team — useful as an oracle when
### tactical scoring changes
# @name bestTactic
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bestTactic/{{teamId}}
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Registered users
# @name users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
